      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a composition rug or composition notebook rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A composition rug, also called a composition notebook rug, is a classroom rug designed to look like a composition notebook cover, usually with space for the teacher's name. Chillgen's composition notebook classroom rugs include white and black designs and start at $31.90."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is a math rug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "A math rug is a classroom rug with math wording or themes, used to mark a math area or small-group math station. Chillgen's math rugs include a \"Problem Solve\" design, a \"Welcome to Math Class\" design with the teacher's name, and a MATH acronym design with a name, all starting at $31.90."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What sizes do composition notebook classroom rugs come in?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Chillgen's square teacher rugs come in 1.6x1.6 ft, 2x2 ft (1 kid), 3x3 ft (2 kids), 4x4 ft (3–4 kids), 5x5 ft (5–7 kids) and 6x6 ft (8–12 kids). Some designs also come in rectangular sizes: 24\"x36\", 36\"x60\", 48\"x72\" and 60\"x96\". Not every design is offered in every size."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can rugs for teachers be personalized with a name?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most can. 45 of the 54 rugs in Chillgen's Teacher Rugs collection say \"Personalizable with a teacher's name\" on their product page. Check the page for the specific design to confirm before ordering."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do teacher rugs have a non-slip backing?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Most do. 45 of the 54 product pages in Chillgen's Teacher Rugs collection list a non-slip neoprene rubber backing. Not every page lists it, so check the product page before ordering a rug for a hard floor."
      }
